# Local Worker dev overrides for `wrangler dev` (copy to `.dev.vars`).
#
# SimpliSafe has NO app-level API credentials — each user's refresh token is
# minted by the connector's own two-step OAuth login at /authorize and stored in
# OAUTH_KV, not configured here. Nothing is required in this file to run the
# hosted connector locally; it exists as the conventional place for any future
# Worker-only dev override.
